#. translators: 1: company name, 2: company address, 3: destination country, 4: privacy policy URL, 5: name of the AI gateway
#: includes/class-consent-disclosure.php:172
#, php-format
msgid "The recipient of the transmitted data is %1$s, %2$s. The AI analysis runs through %5$s, an AI gateway operated by %1$s, which forwards the image and the text data to the AI model vendor named in the privacy policy. This transfers the data to %3$s and leaves the EU into a third country under GDPR Art. 44 ff. The transfer is based on the European Commission's adequacy decision for Brazil, with Standard Contractual Clauses (SCC) as an additional safeguard. See the recipient's privacy policy for full details, including the AI model vendor used: %4$s"
msgstr ""

#. translators: %d: number of days after which the request records are anonymised
#: includes/class-consent-disclosure.php:194
#, php-format
msgid "The purpose of the processing is to generate SEO-optimized titles, alt texts, descriptions and filenames for your images, and to suggest a focus keyword, additional keywords and a website description for your site. The downloaded image is not stored. The service keeps a record of each image request (image URL, keywords, website description, language and the generated texts) and of your website (domain, server IP address, plugin version). After %d days, the personal details in these records are anonymised; only counters such as the number of requests, the language and the outcome remain."
